  "title": "Introducing the Next-Generation Strong-Drive® SDCF TIMBER-CF and SDCFC TIMBER-CFC Black E-Coat Screws: Engineered to Incorporate Simpson Strong-Tie SawTooth® Tip Technology and Meet the Latest Hydrogen Embrittlement Requirements",
  "summary": "In response to the increasing prevalence of mass timber construction and the hydrogen embrittlement requirements defined in CSA O86:24, Simpson Strong-Tie has developed the next-generation Strong-Drive® SDCF Timber-CF (countersink fully threaded screws) and SDCFC TIMBER-CFC (countersink fully threaded cylinder-head) screws with a black e-coat finish.",
